    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "be_api_text",
      "x": 130, "y": 578,
      "width": 350, "height": 114,
      "text": "🔌 API 路由\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nPOST  /api/food/analyze\n      → AI 拍照识别 (5-Stage Pipeline)\nGET   /api/food/composition\n      → 中国食物成分表搜索\nPOST  /api/auth/*\n      → 用户认证相关\nGET   /api/health → 健康检查",
      "originalText": "🔌 API 路由\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nPOST  /api/food/analyze\n      → AI 拍照识别 (5-Stage Pipeline)\nGET   /api/food/composition\n      → 中国食物成分表搜索\nPOST  /api/auth/*\n      → 用户认证相关\nGET   /api/health → 健康检查",
      "fontSize": 12,
